noopener\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16nMY6jEEE/</a><br /><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tmenz6EP7\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tmenz6EP7</a><br /><br />b 站小红书之类搜酷态科 10 号 ultra 一大堆案例。充电头死机之后直接锁定大电压 pd ，非快充设备一插上就可以击穿。<br /><br />这个是酷态科的旗舰头，并且是可以联网 ota 的，所以极大概率是设计缺陷。官方还在装死，至少一年了。", "last_modified": 1794614992, "replies": 90, "id": 1256928}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/0f84/0be9/959_large.png?m=1599117046", "name": "switch", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/0f84/0be9/959_normal.png?m=1599117046", "title": "Nintendo Switch", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/switch", "topics": 588, "footer": "", "header": "任天堂 Switch（日语：ニンテンドースイッチ，英语：Nintendo Switch）是日本任天堂公司出品的电子游戏机，于 2017 年 3 月 3 日开始发售。", "title_alternative": "Nintendo Switch", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/0f84/0be9/959_mini.png?m=1599117046", "stars": 1572, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 959, "parent_node_name": "consoles"}, "member": {"id": 102175, "username": "rrubick", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/rrubick", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_mini.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_normal.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_large.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xlarge.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xxlarge.png?m=1778467100", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9bee/a327/102175_xxxlarge.png?m=1778467100", "created": 1425387702, "last_modified": 1778467100, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "xiaozhu317", "last_touched": 1794594669, "title": "ns2 入手一周感受", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1256832", "created": 1794554293, "deleted": 0, "content": "港版，游戏只买了旷野之息和马里奥派对。\r\n\r\n聊几点感受以及使用情况：\r\n1. 买了内地用的转接头。设置 720p 以后家里电视才连上。\r\n2. 每天掌机模式 3 小时，目前感觉右手手腕有点酸\r\n3. 旷野之息，电量从 80 到 20 续航仅俩小时。目前 6 血，见怪基本靠炸弹炸半天，正面突很容易死。跑图太累了，山高还特别不好爬。感觉能玩很久，也不敢同时买火焰纹章怕玩不过来。神庙全靠观察，不像古墓丽影会告诉你关键道具在哪。\r\n4. 想买双人成行，发现要再买手柄或者一对 joy con ，游戏外设配齐得一点点加钱。虽说买了实体卡可以回血，但估计短时间不可能了。\r\n5. 怕小学生上瘾，不敢带着玩。只能晚上跟老婆玩一会。\r\n\r\n总体来说还是很开心的，男人至死是少年，怀念小学去同学家玩双截龙的日子（最喜欢 2 代）。", "content_rendered": "港版，游戏只买了旷野之息和马里奥派对。<br /><br />聊几点感受以及使用情况：<br />1. 买了内地用的转接头。设置 720p 以后家里电视才连上。<br />2. 每天掌机模式 3 小时，目前感觉右手手腕有点酸<br />3. 旷野之息，电量从 80 到 20 续航仅俩小时。目前 6 血，见怪基本靠炸弹炸半天，正面突很容易死。跑图太累了，山高还特别不好爬。感觉能玩很久，也不敢同时买火焰纹章怕玩不过来。神庙全靠观察，不像古墓丽影会告诉你关键道具在哪。<br />4. 想买双人成行，发现要再买手柄或者一对 joy con ，游戏外设配齐得一点点加钱。虽说买了实体卡可以回血，但估计短时间不可能了。<br />5. 怕小学生上瘾，不敢带着玩。只能晚上跟老婆玩一会。<br /><br />总体来说还是很开心的，男人至死是少年，怀念小学去同学家玩双截龙的日子（最喜欢 2 代）。", "last_modified": 1794554293, "replies": 51, "id": 1256832}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_large.png?m=1733731195", "name": "programmer", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_normal.png?m=1733731195", "title": "程序员", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/programmer", "topics": 74439, "footer": "", "header": "While code monkeys are not eating bananas, they're coding.", "title_alternative": "Programmer", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/94f6/d7e0/300_mini.png?m=1733731195", "stars": 9830, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 300, "parent_node_name": "computer"}, "member": {"id": 90798, "username": "zt4027050", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/zt4027050", "website": "www.kevinzoro.cn", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/45a2/526a/90798_mini.png?m=1793692456", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/45a2/526a/90798_normal.png?m=1793692456", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/45a2/526a/90798_large.png?m=1793692456", "created": 1420774900, "last_modified": 1793692456, "pro": 0}, "last_reply