问题的？", "content_rendered": "现在公司给开 claude 、codex 和 grokbot 。<br />主力开发使用 claude opus 5.5 ，然后 harness 本身有 review ，<br />但是 opus review 通过了之后，让同事用 sol-6.1 max 再 review ，还是会有一些边界问题。<br />头疼，来回拉扯耗时间。<br />佬们怎么解决这个问题的？", "last_modified": 1794552529, "replies": 32, "id": 1256817}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/7327/8a4a/113_large.png?m=1679004895", "name": "hongkong", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/7327/8a4a/113_normal.png?m=1679004895", "title": "香港", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/hongkong", "topics": 368, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Hong Kong", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/7327/8a4a/113_mini.png?m=1679004895", "stars": 593, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 113, "parent_node_name": "cn"}, "member": {"id": 531861, "username": "Ma1agu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/Ma1agu", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2a3/6396/531861_mini.png?m=1794554219", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2a3/6396/531861_normal.png?m=1794554219", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2a3/6396/531861_large.png?m=1794554219", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b2a3/6396/531861_xlarge.png?m=1794554219", "created": 1612344464, "last_modified": 1794554219, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "dream0689", "last_touched": 1794578105, "title": "好哥哥们，明天俺去香港开港卡，请教各位有什么需要注意的事项？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1256838", "created": 1794554621, "deleted": 0, "content": "明天准备过关去香港线上办港卡，目前了解了一些基础信息，但还是想请教一下有经验的老哥们：\r\n\r\n目前准备的材料和情况：\r\n1. 身份证、港澳通行证\r\n2. 提前开通了手机港澳漫游\r\n3. 打算过关后主要线上申请中银香港（ BOCHK ）、汇丰（ HSBC ）以及众安（ ZA Bank ）\r\n\r\n主要想请教大家这几个问题：\r\n- **关于入金**：后续怎么入金最方便、最省手续费？\r\n- **关于券商**：开好港卡后想顺便搞个港美股账户，现在还能开哪些券商？\r\n- **关于香港电话卡**：打算顺便办张香港电话卡，有什么推荐买的卡或需要注意的地方吗？\r\n- **吃喝玩乐与买买买**：办完之后还有不少时间，老哥们推荐去哪里逛逛玩一下？有没有什么值得一吃的美食或值得买的东西？\r\n\r\n感谢各位好哥哥指点！", "content_rendered": "<p>明天准备过关去香港线上办港卡，目前了解了一些基础信息，但还是想请教一下有经验的老哥们：</p>\n<p>目前准备的材料和情况：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>身份证、港澳通行证</li>\n<li>提前开通了手机港澳漫游</li>\n<li>打算过关后主要线上申请中银香港（ BOCHK ）、汇丰（ HSBC ）以及众安（ ZA Bank ）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>主要想请教大家这几个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>关于入金</strong>：后续怎么入金最方便、最省手续费？</li>\n<li><strong>关于券商</strong>：开好港卡后想顺便搞个港美股账户，现在还能开哪些券商？</li>\n<li><strong>关于香港电话卡</strong>：打算顺便办张香港电话卡，有什么推荐买的卡或需要注意的地方吗？</li>\n<li><strong>吃喝玩乐与买买买</strong>：办完之后还有不少时间，老哥们推荐去哪里逛逛玩一下？有没有什么值得一吃的美食或值得买的东西？</li>\n</ul>\n<p>感谢各位好哥哥指点！</p>\n", "last_modified": 1794554621, "replies": 31, "id": 1256838}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 12100, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2552, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 1055, "username": "diudiuu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/diudiuu", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_mini.png?m=1794219750", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_normal.png?m=1794219750", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_large.png?m=1794219750", "avatar_xlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_xlarge.png?m=1794219750", "avatar_xxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_xxlarge.png?m=1794219750", "avatar_xxxlarge": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/53c0/4118/1055_xxxlarge.png?m=1794219750", "created": 1281690618, "last_modified": 1794219750, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "summertree", "last_touched": 1794633374, "title": "有小孩了,想每年给小孩存一点钱,大家推荐什么", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1256985",